~ start
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Farah: hi!

=> two_hearts

=> END

~ one_heart
%
	Farah: Violet, right? 
	$> Global.expression = "elated"
	Farah: it's nice to see you again!!
	$> Global.expression = "happy"
	Farah: how has your day been?
	- bad
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		$> Global.far_meter -= 5
		$> Global.wrong += 1
		Farah: aww, how come? 
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Farah: wait, actually you don't have to tell me
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		Farah: I mean you can, if you want, I just don't want to pry into personal issues, y'know?
		Farah: anyway, I hope your day gets better
	- good
		$> Global.hearts_up = true
		$> Global.hearts_up = true
		$> Global.happiness -= 3
		$> Global.far_meter += 2
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: yayy! that's good
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: I hope the rest of your day is good too
	=> questions
% 
	Farah: I like your pencil case
	- thank you!
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: no problem!
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: I mean, it is really cute, hehe
	- it was a gift 
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		$> Global.hearts_up = true
		$> Global.happiness += 2
		$> Global.far_meter += 2
		Farah: ahh, that's nice!
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: they picked a good gift then, hehe!
	- it's from ...
		$> Global.hearts_up = true
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		$> Global.far_meter += 4
		$> Global.happiness -=2
		Farah: ooo ok, I was wondering hehe
		Farah: I think I've heard of that store!
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: I'll have to check it out sometime then!

	=> questions
%
	Farah: do you get what's going on right now?
	- yea, are you slow?
		$> Global.expression = "laugh"
		$> Global.far_meter -= 2
		$> Global.wrong += 1
		Farah: oh haha... yea, I guess I am 
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: But yay! I'm happy you get it though
	- I think
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		$> Global.far_meter += 2
		$> Global.happiness -= 2
		$> Global.hearts_up = true
		Farah: hehe, that's better then no!
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Farah: umm, can you help me with this question...
		- hold on a sec
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			Farah: ok! [$> Global.happiness += 4][$> Global.wrong += 1]
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Farah: ...
			$> Global.expression = "laugh"
			$> Global.far_meter -= 2
			Farah: actually, nevermind, it's ok!
		- sure
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			$> Global.hearts_up = true
			$> Global.far_meter += 4
			$> Global.happiness -= 2
			Farah: really? thank you so much!!
			$> Global.expression = "unsure"
			Farah: ...
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			Farah: ok! I think I get it now
			Farah: you're really good at explaining it!
	=> questions
=> END


~ two_hearts
% 
	$> Global.expression = "elated"
	Farah: hey, have you heard, there's a new Spiderboy movie out!
	- I didn't take you for someone who likes superhero movies?
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.far_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.expression = "laugh"
		Farah: Oh, yea that's totally fair haha
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Farah: Val was surprised too when I told her
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: My cousin got me into the movies when I was a kid!
		Farah: and something about the movies gets me really hyped and inspired!
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Farah: of course, I think the newer movies aren't nearly as good as the older ones
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		Farah: they've been, such big cash grabs!
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Farah: ahh, sorry was that too much...
		- no, it's nice seeing you so passionate about this
			$> Global.dialogue_meter_up(Global.far_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS * 3)
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			Farah: aww, really
			Farah: that makes me really happy
			$> Global.expression = "happy"
			Farah: ok, I can keep going haha!
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			: you and Farah have a heated convo about the Spiderboy franchise
		- no, I totally agree!
			$> Global.dialogue_meter_up(Global.far_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
			$> Global.happiness -= 2
			$> Global.expression = "elated"
			Farah: yes! thank you
			Farah: like...
			: you and Farah have a heated convo about the Spiderboy franchise
	- yea! I heard
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_up(Global.far_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.happiness -= 2
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: yay that's great!
	$> Global.expression = "happy"
	Farah: sooo, would you be interested in watching it after school today?
	$> Global.expression = "laugh"
	Farah: Val's not that interested in the franchise, and you know how Christine's schedule is haha
	- sure
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_up(Global.far_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Farah: great! let's go quickly after school
		$> Global.expression = "unsure"
		Farah: I think the next screening is at... 4pm
		$> Global.expression = "laugh"
		Farah: so we'll have to hurry
		Farah: hope that's ok hehe
		=> END
	- I'm busy
		$> Global.dialogue_meter_down(Global.far_meter, Global.HEART_POINTS)
		$> Global.expression = "sad"
		Farah: ohh... that's ok!
		$> Global.expression = "laugh"
		Farah: maybe some other time then


~ questions
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Farah: ...
- compliment
	% => good
	%2 => bad
- joke 
	% => joke_good
	% => joke_bad
- open up [if Global.far_meter > Global.FOUR_HEARTS]
- end convo
=> END

~ good
Farah: ...  [$> Global.far_meter += 4][$> Global.happiness += 2]
$> Global.expression = "elated"
$> Global.hearts_up = true
Farah: aww, really?
Farah: thanks Violet!
=> bell
=> END

~ bad
Farah: ... [$> Global.far_meter -= 4][$> Global.happiness -= 4][$> Global.wrong += 1]
$> Global.expression = "laugh"
Farah: oh, ok haha...
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_good
Farah: ... [$> Global.far_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
$> Global.expression = "elated"
$> Global.hearts_up = true
Farah: hehehe
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_bad
Farah: ... [$> Global.far_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
$> Global.expression = "laugh"
Farah: oh, haha...
=> bell
=> END

~ bell
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Farah: ok, let's focus now!
=> END